  "details": "Description\n\nwith the new version of unity im lagging a lot more and it seems heavily cpu bound, i have an i9 12900k and a 5070 and 32 gb of ddr4 3200mhz cl16 ram recently the game has been limiting my fps to 50 in every world even yts and prismics, and also happening to my friends i can see their fps and they arevall getting 50-60 fps while also using only 20-30 percent of gpu, its not the world nor avatars since really optimised worlds and really optimised robot avatars dont make sense, ive done everything like updating drivers so its not neglegence on my end.  and also even lagging in worlds by my self\n\nReproduction Steps\n\ni dont lag in worlds that never got updated weirdly enough, like old worlds last updates 2022\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
